--the chief function in a marriage; Deva- यानी claims that this happened to her by ययाति when he rescued her from the well;
1: M. ३०. २१.
reference to the marriage between शिव and उमा;
2: Ib. ६०. १५.
according to fire rite;
3: Ib. १५४. ४८४.
of शिव at काञ्चि.
4: Br. IV. ३९. ६१.

--The five sons of पाण्डु (s.v.); rumour that they were burnt in the house of lac built by Duryodhana; their escape in the disguise of Brahmanas; met by कृष्ण in a Potter's hall in पाञ्चाल city;
1: भा. X. ५७. 1, १०[2-4]; Br. III. ७१. ६५.
married Draupadi;
2: वा. ९९. २४०, २४६.
कृष्ण sent अक्रूर to हस्तिनापुर to find out their position; seen by अक्रूर; अक्रूर pleaded their cause with धृतराष्ट्र and reported his designs to कृष्ण and राम;
3: Ib. X. ४८. ३२-25; ४९. 2, १९ and ३१.
praised the heroic exploits of कृष्ण;
4: Ib. IX. २४. ६३; वा. ७७. ४८.
कृष्ण who heard them burnt down, performed obsequies to.
5: Ib. ९६. ६३.
